#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:6
msgid "Recording video"
msgstr "录制视频"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:10
msgid ""
"This guide shows how to record ``mp4`` clips from a visualizer or a scene "
"sensor during a run."
msgstr "本指南介绍如何在运行过程中，从可视化器或场景传感器录制 ``mp4`` 视频片段。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:21
msgid ""
"Each ``VideoRecorderCfg`` entry is independent: different sources write "
"different files at their own cadence, with no limit on simultaneous "
"recorders."
msgstr "每个 ``VideoRecorderCfg`` 条目独立运行：不同数据源按照各自的录制周期写入不同文件，同时运行的录制器数量没有限制。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:26
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:28
msgid "Add a ``VideoRecorderCfg`` to ``env_cfg.video_recorders``:"
msgstr "在 ``env_cfg.video_recorders`` 中添加 ``VideoRecorderCfg`` ："

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:38
msgid ""
"Or pass ``--video`` on the command line to record without editing the "
"environment config. It records the first capture-capable visualizer selected"
" by ``--viz``. Without ``--viz``, it uses the first configured visualizer "
"(preferring one that supports capture), or creates a headless Kit visualizer"
" when none is configured. To record several sources at once, list one "
"``VideoRecorderCfg`` per source in ``env_cfg.video_recorders``; "
"``--video_length`` and ``--video_interval`` apply to every recorder:"
msgstr ""
"也可以在命令行传入 ``--video``，无需修改环境配置即可录制。它会录制 ``--viz`` 选中的第一个支持帧捕获的可视化器。未传入 "
"``--viz`` 时，使用已配置的第一个可视化器，并优先选择支持捕获的可视化器；未配置任何可视化器时，会创建无界面 Kit "
"可视化器。要同时录制多个数据源，应在 ``env_cfg.video_recorders`` 中为每个数据源配置一个 "
"``VideoRecorderCfg``。``--video_length`` 和 ``--video_interval`` 对所有录制器生效："

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:49
msgid ""
"See :ref:`the --video sources <record_video_cli>` for the command-line "
"selection rules, and `Sources`_ and `Clip control`_ below for the "
"``VideoRecorderCfg`` options. To record from a different camera angle than "
"the interactive view, see `Recording from an independent camera angle`_."
msgstr ""
"命令行的数据源选择规则见 :ref:`--video 数据源 <record_video_cli>`；``VideoRecorderCfg`` "
"选项见下文的 `数据源 <Sources_>`_ 和 `片段控制 <Clip control_>`_。需要使用不同于交互视图的相机角度时，见 "
"`从独立相机视角录制 <Recording from an independent camera angle_>`_。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:74
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:76
msgid ""
"All three examples use the Shadow Hand cube-reorientation task, ``Isaac-"
"Reorient-Cube-Shadow-Camera-Direct``, which ships with a built-in tiled "
"camera sensor. Examples 1 and 2 each demonstrate one recording source; "
"Example 3 combines all four."
msgstr ""
"这三个示例均使用 Shadow Hand 立方体重定向任务 ``Isaac-Reorient-Cube-Shadow-Camera-Direct`` "
"，该任务内置平铺相机传感器。示例 1 和 2 分别演示一种录制来源，示例 3 则组合全部四种来源。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:0
msgid "Code for run_video_recording.py"
msgstr "run_video_recording.py 的代码"

