msgstr "以下命令行和配置示例不属于教程脚本，可按实际需要使用。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:188
msgid "Recording during RL training"
msgstr "在强化学习训练中录制"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:190
msgid ""
"Record a short clip at regular intervals while training, without opening a "
"window:"
msgstr "训练时不打开窗口，按固定间隔录制短片段："

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:198
msgid ""
"With no ``--viz`` or configured visualizer, ``--video`` records from a "
"headless Kit visualizer. This writes a 200-step clip every 2,000 steps. The "
"``train`` and ``play`` entrypoints put clips in ``videos/`` under the run's "
"log directory unless a recorder sets ``output_dir``; a script that builds "
"its own recorders writes to ``output_dir`` (default ``videos``). Add ``--viz"
" kit`` to watch the run in a window while recording the same view."
msgstr ""
"未传入 ``--viz`` 且未配置可视化器时，``--video`` 使用无界面 Kit 可视化器录制。此例每隔 2,000 步录制一个 200 "
"步的视频片段。``train`` 和 ``play`` 入口默认将片段保存到本次运行日志目录下的 ``videos/``；录制器设置 "
"``output_dir`` 时使用该目录。自行创建录制器的脚本写入 ``output_dir``，其默认值为 ``videos``。添加 "
"``--viz kit`` 可以在窗口中查看运行过程，同时录制相同视角。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:205
msgid "Recording depth or segmentation from a scene sensor"
msgstr "从场景传感器录制深度或分割结果"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:207
msgid ""
"Append a channel to the sensor source to record something other than RGB. "
"Each recorder writes its own file, so several channels of one camera can be "
"recorded in the same run:"
msgstr "在传感器数据源后追加通道名称，即可录制 RGB 以外的数据。每个录制器写入独立文件，因此一次运行可以同时录制同一相机的多个通道："

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:217
msgid ""
"Depth uses the turbo colormap over ``depth_colormap_min`` to "
"``depth_colormap_max``. Use the same prefix-per-recorder pattern for "
"``segmentation`` and ``normals``."
msgstr ""
"深度使用 turbo 色图，映射范围为 ``depth_colormap_min`` 到 "
"``depth_colormap_max``。``segmentation`` 和 ``normals`` 同样可以为每个录制器设置独立文件名前缀。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:221
msgid "Recording while streaming with Viser or Rerun"
msgstr "使用 Viser 或 Rerun 查看视频流时录制"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:223
msgid ""
"Viser and Rerun stream to a browser or viewer and have no frame capture, so "
"they cannot be recorded. Pair them with a capture-capable visualizer that "
"runs headless next to them:"
msgstr "Viser 和 Rerun 向浏览器或查看器发送视频流，但不提供帧捕获，无法直接录制。可以同时运行一个支持帧捕获的无界面可视化器："

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:238
msgid ""
"Alternatively, record directly from a scene camera with "
"``source=\"sensor:<name>\"``, which needs no visualizer."
msgstr "也可以设置 ``source=\"sensor:<name>\"``，直接从场景相机录制，无需可视化器。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:244
msgid "Recording from an independent camera angle"
msgstr "从独立相机视角录制"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:246
msgid ""
"Configure the recording angle on the visualizer, not the recorder. To record"
" from a headless Newton visualizer at a different angle alongside an "
"interactive Kit viewer, configure both and omit ``--viz`` so the "
"configuration selects them:"
msgstr ""
"录制视角应在可视化器配置中设置，而不是在录制器中设置。要一边使用交互式 Kit 查看器，一边从不同视角的无界面 Newton "
"可视化器录制，应配置两个可视化器，并省略 ``--viz``，由配置决定启动哪些可视化器："

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:263
msgid ""
"Alternatively, use a :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.CameraCfg` sensor in the "
"scene and record with ``source=\"sensor:<name>\"``, which gives full control"
" over the recording viewpoint without requiring a second interactive "
"visualizer."
msgstr ""
"也可以在场景中使用 :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.CameraCfg` 传感器，并通过 "
"``source=\"sensor:<name>\"`` 录制。这样可以完全控制录制视角，无需第二个交互式可视化器。"

