#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:302
msgid ""
"The camera angle, resolution, and other visualizer settings are configured "
"on the corresponding visualizer config, not on the recorder. A named "
"visualizer source must also have a matching active visualizer in "
"``sim.visualizer_cfgs``. Set its ``headless=True`` when it should capture "
"without a window. The deprecated ``visualizer:newton`` source still selects "
"Newton GL; use ``visualizer:newton_gl``."
msgstr ""
"相机视角、分辨率和其他可视化设置在相应的可视化器配置中设置，而不是在录制器中设置。指定名称的可视化器数据源，必须在 "
"``sim.visualizer_cfgs`` 中有对应的已启用可视化器。需要无窗口捕获时，设置 ``headless=True``。已弃用的 "
"``visualizer:newton`` 仍会选择 Newton GL，新配置应使用 ``visualizer:newton_gl``。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:309
msgid ""
"The Newton RTX viewer framebuffer can be recorded with "
