#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:363
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:365
msgid ""
"``source=\"visualizer:kit\"`` and "
"``source=\"visualizer:kit:streaming_view\"`` require cubric to propagate "
"Newton Fabric scene transforms to the RTX renderer.  Without cubric, a "
"warning is logged and a black-frame warning is emitted at clip write time.  "
"Use ``source=\"visualizer:newton_gl\"`` for guaranteed capture with Newton "
"physics."
msgstr ""
"``source=\"visualizer:kit\"`` 和 ``source=\"visualizer:kit:streaming_view\"``"
" 需要 cubric 将 Newton Fabric 场景变换传递给 RTX 渲染器。缺少 cubric "
"时会记录警告，并在写出视频片段时给出黑帧警告。使用 Newton 物理后端时，可选择 "
"``source=\"visualizer:newton_gl\"``，确保能够捕获画面。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:370
msgid ""
"``source=\"visualizer:newton_gl:streaming_view\"`` and "
"``source=\"visualizer:kit:streaming_view\"`` require ``streaming_view=True``"
" on the corresponding visualizer cfg.  A :class:`~RuntimeError` is raised at"
" the first capture attempt if it is not set."
msgstr ""
"``source=\"visualizer:newton_gl:streaming_view\"`` 和 "
"``source=\"visualizer:kit:streaming_view\"`` 要求相应可视化器配置设置 "
"``streaming_view=True``；否则，首次尝试捕获帧时会抛出 :class:`~RuntimeError` 。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:374
msgid ""
"For ``source=\"sensor:<name>\"``, the named sensor must exist on the scene "
"config with the recorded channel (``\"rgb\"`` by default) in its "
"``data_types``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``source=\"sensor:<name>\"`` 时，场景配置中必须存在该名称的传感器，其 ``data_types`` "
"必须包含待录制通道，默认通道为 ``\"rgb\"``。"

