#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:386
msgid ""
"Launches Isaac Sim; the launch enables camera rendering for the recording."
msgstr "启动 Isaac Sim，并在启动时为录制启用相机渲染。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:387
msgid "``newton_gl``"
msgstr "``newton_gl``"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:389
msgid ""
"Uses pyglet's EGL backend when headless; select it with ``--viz newton_gl`` "
"or configure a ``NewtonGLVisualizerCfg``."
msgstr ""
"无界面模式下使用 pyglet 的 EGL 后端；通过 ``--viz newton_gl`` 选择，或配置 "
"``NewtonGLVisualizerCfg``。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:391
msgid "``newton_rtx``"
msgstr "``newton_rtx``"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:393
msgid ""
"Starts the OVRTX runtime; capture performs a GPU-to-CPU readback of the "
"path-traced framebuffer."
msgstr "启动 OVRTX 运行时；捕获帧时，将路径追踪帧缓冲区从 GPU 回读到 CPU。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:395
msgid "``rerun``"
msgstr "``rerun``"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:396 source/how-to/record_video.rst:400
msgid "✗"
msgstr "✗"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:397
msgid ""
"Remote streaming tool; no local frame-capture API. ``--video --viz rerun`` "
"raises an error; select it together with a capture-capable visualizer to "
"record."
msgstr "远程视频流工具，没有本地帧捕获 API。``--video --viz rerun`` 会报错；录制时需同时选择一个支持帧捕获的可视化器。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:399
msgid "``viser``"
msgstr "``viser``"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:401
msgid ""
"Browser streaming tool; no local frame-capture API. ``--video --viz viser`` "
"raises an error; select it together with a capture-capable visualizer to "
"record."
msgstr ""
"浏览器视频流工具，没有本地帧捕获 API。``--video --viz viser`` 会报错；录制时需同时选择一个支持帧捕获的可视化器。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:404
msgid ""
"To record video while streaming with Rerun or Viser, see `Recording while "
"streaming with Viser or Rerun`_."
msgstr ""
"使用 Rerun 或 Viser 查看视频流时的录制方法，见 `使用 Viser 或 Rerun 查看视频流时录制 <Recording while "
"streaming with Viser or Rerun_>`_。"

